{"title":"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph of the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/5/335977913022df1fb3a473f90be2743ad42ada67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=mx+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" /> is shown. Which of the following is true?\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2004_AMC_12A_Problem_5.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/9/9a/2004_AMC_12A_Problem_5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"141\" height=\"132\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/1/ca1cab4cfb01c48aabe6a6dbc537b2cc3c323c84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm {(A)} mb&lt;-1 \\qquad \\mathrm {(B)} -1&lt;mb&lt;0 \\qquad \\mathrm {(C)} mb=0 \\qquad \\mathrm {(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"449\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/8/3e88ca3e2a41c8b13f7024c98332d6d9c16f2783.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0&lt;mb&lt;1 \\qquad \\mathrm {(E)} mb&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"206\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The line appears to have a slope of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/3/1f34e107d86da678433f83f6fdb5843aee8d6007.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" /> and y-intercept of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/1/af171b50efff5981bffa32b6903c7aa601c8ed7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{4}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> up.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/d/ffd4ae84b56126399eb0edc16e1690380b2bf0ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{4}{5}\\cdot \\dfrac{-1}{2}=\\dfrac{-4}{10} \\Rightarrow \\mathrm {(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"158\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A\">2004 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2